There were some, I guess you would call them
deflated.

00:02:48.299 --> 00:02:50.939
Trump is who also abandoned.

00:02:50.939 --> 00:02:55.549
And it's also relevant to think about the
untold damage that Hannity did throughout

00:02:55.549 --> 00:02:56.780
Trump's presidency.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:02.079
And one of the reasons Trump didn't face the
